      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2014 Society of Cardiovascular Computed Tomography. Published by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Aneurysms of the branches of the coronary arteries are rare. We report a case of a right coronary artery aneurysm with aneurysmal dilation and thrombosis of the sinoatrial nodal branch presenting as a right atrial mass. The patient underwent multiple imaging evaluations before coronary CT angiography diagnosed aneurysm and thrombosis of the sinoatrial nodal branch."
      },
